  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "投递细节",
      "items": [
        "HandlerWorker.schedule 把 Runnable 包成 ScheduledRunnable，再包装成 Message 交给 Handler",
        "message.obj 记录 worker，dispose 时 removeCallbacksAndMessages(this) 可一次性清掉该 worker 的所有消息"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "释放语义",
      "items": [
        "MainThreadDisposable.dispose 用 CAS 防重入；已在主线程就直接 onDispose，否则 scheduleDirect 切回主线程",
        "ScheduledRunnable.dispose 只 removeCallbacks，真正取消由 handler 消息队列完成"
      ]
    }
  ]
